#. module: account_asset
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_asset/wizard/asset_modify.py:0
msgid ""
"A journal entry will transfer the asset value from <strong><em>\"%"
"(old_account)s\"</em></strong> to <strong><em>\"%(new_account)s\"</em></"
"strong> on <strong>%(date)s</strong>.<br/> The current asset will be closed "
"and a new asset will be created with the same book value.<br/> Depreciation "
"will begin from <strong>%(date)s</strong> using the depreciation parameters "
"configured on the new account."
msgstr ""
"資産価値を <strong><em>「%(old_account)s」</em></strong> から <strong><em>「%"
"(new_account)s」</em></strong> へ振り替える仕訳が<strong>%(date)s</strong>に"
"作成されます。<br/>現在の資産はクローズされ、同じ帳簿価額で新しい資産が作成さ"
"れます。<br/>減価償却は <strong>%(date)s</strong> から開始され、新しい勘定科"
"目に設定された減価償却パラメータが使用されます。"

#. module: account_asset
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_asset/models/account_depreciation_model.py:0
msgid ""
"A journal with a ledger is required to create a depreciation model in this "
"context."
msgstr "この文脈で減価償却モデルを作成するには、元帳付きの仕訳帳が必要です。"

#. module: account_asset
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_asset/models/account_asset_ledger_variant.py:0
msgid ""
"A ledger sub-asset is closed together with its asset. Dispose of the asset "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"台帳の子資産は、親資産と同時にクローズされます。代わりに、親資産を除却してく"
"ださい。"

#. module: account_asset
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_asset/models/account_asset.py:0
msgid ""
"A non deductible tax value of %(tax_value)s was added to %(name)s's initial "
"value of %(purchase_value)s"
msgstr ""
"控除対象外税額%(tax_value)s が%(name)sの初期値%(purchase_value)sに追加されま"
"した"

#. module: account_asset
#: model:ir.model,name:account_asset.model_account_account
msgid "Account"
msgstr "勘定科目"

#. module: account_asset
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_asset/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"Account %(account)s should have accumulated depreciation and depreciation "
"expense accounts set in order to generate an asset"
msgstr ""
"資産を生成するには、勘定科目 %(account)s に「減価償却累計額」勘定および「減価"
"償却費」勘定が設定されている必要があります"

#. module: account_asset
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_asset/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"Account %(name)s cannot be used to create an asset. The account must be of "
"the Fixed Asset type."
msgstr ""
"勘定科目 %(name)s は資産の作成に使用できません。勘定科目の種別は「固定資産」"
"である必要があります。"

#. module: account_asset
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_asset/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"Account %(name)s not setup to generate assets. Depreciation model and asset "
"accounts need to be set on account."
msgstr ""
"勘定科目 %(name)s は資産を生成する設定になっていません。勘定科目に、減価償却"
"モデルおよび資産用の勘定科目を設定する必要があります。"

#. module: account_asset
