msgstr "資産購買時の取得価格を記録する勘定科目。"

#. module: account_asset
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_asset.field_account_asset_variant__recovery_account_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_asset.field_account_depreciation_model__ledger_recovery_account_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_asset.field_depreciation_ledger_wizard__recovery_account_id
msgid ""
"Account used to record the reversal of excess depreciation when statutory "
"depreciation catches up or the asset is disposed of."
msgstr ""
"法定償却が追いついた際、または資産を処分した際に、超過償却額の戻入を記録する"
"ために使用する勘定科目。"

#. module: account_asset
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_asset.field_asset_modify__gain_account_id
